  "name": "Seafood Sausage",
  "subtitle": "Chilled seafood sausages with lemon-butter sauce",
  "description": "A delicate blend of sole, salmon, shrimp, and egg whites is poached, chilled, sliced, and browned before being served with a simple lemon-butter sauce.",
